Foreground: yellow_2
Description: Nova Starling
LongDescription: Nova Starling, Leader of Terra Vitae, is a visionary and determined environmentalist. Her childhood dream of 'eating the skies' symbolized freedom and the limitless potential of nature. After losing her father to corporate greed, Nova became a fierce advocate for decentralized, self-sustaining communities. Her leadership inspires hope and resilience among those seeking liberation from corporate oppression.
